  "findings": [
    "The C07.1 embedded Bases integration was pushed to origin/main as exact SHA 21b275c74fdb61402d30205182cb66c1c8d4e9a4.",
    "Five of seven required workflows passed: inventory 38225556448; quality 38225556462; desktop build 38225556449; plugin renderer 38225556360; and loaded-plugin workflows 38225556379. All platform jobs in the four matrix workflows passed.",
    "Rust CI run 38225556463 failed on MSRV job 114732063429 and Ubuntu, Windows, and macOS jobs 114732063616, 114732063617, and 114732063737. The new embedded Bases UI test returned the previous view index (0 instead of 1) on MSRV, Ubuntu, and macOS. Windows could not find the fixture accessibility label because the test used slash-separated path construction. Ubuntu also reported rustfmt differences in the touched Rust sources.",
